    ay_ctl_combustible_para: "To propose the fuel for each service: kilometres divided by mileage, times the price, plus the margin.",
    ay_ctl_combustible_cuando: "With an old price, the fuel allowance comes out short or long on every service.",
    ay_ctl_categorias_para: "The mileage used to work out fuel, and the photo on the service sheet.",
