    cal_cuales: "which",
    cal_datos_sub: "What's missing for the system to calculate correctly and for the service sheet to be complete.",
    cal_principales: "The month in five figures",
    ay_cal_arriba_para: "To see at a glance how the month is doing against the month before: satisfaction, punctuality, complete reports, on-time closings and low ratings.",
    ay_cal_arriba_cuando: "An amber arrow means that figure got worse than the month before. The current month goes up to today.",
    ay_cal_arriba_numero: "Punctuality: the arrival marked inside the point and no later than the scheduled time, person by person and day by day; the one entered by hand by the control center isn't measured. Complete report: arrival, contact and end, with no silence alerts. Closed within 24 hours: the consultant's sign-off within their deadline, the same one that decides their commission.",
    ay_cal_cliente_para: "What the client rated in the service survey, and what the requester rated about their consultant.",
    ay_cal_cliente_cuando: "A rating of 3 or less that hasn't been reviewed waits for the consultant: it's classified in Clients.",
    ay_cal_cliente_numero: "Counts the surveys sent in the month. One not answered within 15 days expires.",
    ay_cal_calle_para: "What happened in the field: marks away from the point, marks the control center must validate, replacements and vehicles.",
    ay_cal_calle_cuando: "A vehicle handed over without its inspection is damage that can't be attributed to anyone later.",
    ay_cal_calle_numero: "Replacements count contingencies; vacations, days off and preventive maintenance don't.",
    ay_cal_cierre_para: "How the month was closed: the consultant's sign-off, what finance returned and the money the staff accounted for.",
    ay_cal_cierre_cuando: "A late closing costs the consultant their commission; expenses accounted for late cost the staff their bonus.",
    ay_cal_cierre_numero: "Each closing counts in the month its deadline falls; one still within its deadline isn't counted.",
    ay_cal_gente_para: "The people: incidents, certificates, the bonus and professionalism.",
    ay_cal_gente_cuando: "Whoever works with an expired course lets the client down the day it matters: re-enroll them before.",
    ay_cal_gente_numero: "The bonus is the month's if it's already calculated —it's calculated on the 3rd of the next month—; if not, the previous month's.",
    ay_cal_datos_para: "What's missing so the system calculates correctly and the service sheet is complete.",
    ay_cal_datos_cuando: "What's in Odoo is fixed in Odoo and arrives on its own with the hourly reading; what's in Catalogs is fixed here.",
