    ay_pro_para_quien_para: "Who the proposal is for, who signs it and where the service runs. The client gives its dedicated-service price list; the requester, the “Attention” line of the PDF; the consultant, their signature and the email the client replies to. At the top, the country tab: the list brings only that country's clients, and a company not yet in Odoo belongs to that country.",
    ay_pro_para_quien_cuando: "Right here: below it says what is missing before it can be sent. The start date, if known, appears in the PDF and becomes the dedicated service's start day.",
    pro_ciudad: "City where it runs",
    pro_inicio: "Start date, if known",
    pro_inicio_pie: "It becomes the dedicated service's start day.",
    pro_lleva: "2 · What it includes, per month",
    pro_lleva_pie: "Each position is one person every day of the modality; each vehicle, the whole month. With the client's dedicated-service list the monthly fee is calculated: its daily price times the days of the modality or, if the list has it per month, that monthly fee as is. Typing another monthly fee makes it a special price.",
    ay_pro_lleva_para: "What is sold to the client each month: the positions, the vehicles, or the driver with the vehicle if the list has that package, each with its monthly fee.",
    ay_pro_lleva_cuando: "Right here: each line shows its daily price right away and whether it comes from the list or is special. A line without a price blocks sending it.",
    ay_pro_lleva_numero: "The list's monthly fee is its full-day price times 22, 26 or 30 days, depending on the modality; if the list has it per month —the Amazon Brazil package—, that monthly fee as is, and its daily price is the monthly fee divided by those days. The daily price of a typed one is its monthly fee divided by those days.",
