    /* --- Logistica, AI/LG: los catalogos (seccion 150) */
    nav_operaciones_lg: "LG Operations",
    nav_lg_catalogos: "LG catalogs",
    rec_lg_catalogos: "What Logistics uses to work out the margin, the advance and the pay of each trip: the commission table, diesel, costs, the bonus, vehicle types and yards, each with the date it applies from.",
    rol_logistica: "Logistics",
    lgc_titulo: "Logistics catalogs",
    lgc_sub: "What the system uses to work out the margin, the advance and the pay of each trip. Each value applies from its date: a change does not erase the previous one, and a closed trip keeps the ones it used.",
    lgc_pestana_catalogos: "Catalogs",
    lgc_pestana_bitacora: "Log",
    lgc_grupo_dinero: "They decide money",
    lgc_grupo_dinero_pie: "They are used to work out the margin, the advance and the pay of each trip.",
    lgc_grupo_sistema: "Kept by Systems and quality",
    lgc_tabulador: "Commission table",
    lgc_diesel: "Diesel and advance",
    lgc_alimentos: "Meals and minimum margin",
    lgc_operador: "Driver cost",
    lgc_costos: "Fuel efficiency and cost by type",
    lgc_costos_titulo: "Fuel efficiency and cost by vehicle type",
    lgc_bono: "Mobility bonus and guarantee",
    lgc_bono_titulo: "Mobility bonus and weekly guarantee",
    lgc_tipos: "Vehicle types",
    lgc_patios: "Yards",
    lgc_tabulador_pie: "What the driver is paid per trip by vehicle type: an amount for the first loaded km and another for each additional loaded km. Loaded km are those of the planned loaded route plus the authorized extra km, never the odometer's. Each trip is paid with the table in force on its date.",
    lgc_diesel_pie: "The price per litre used to estimate each trip's diesel, the buffer added to the diesel advance and the tolerance of the fuel efficiency check at closing. Each one applies from its own date.",
    lgc_alimentos_pie: "What the driver gets per day for meals, in the advance and in the trip cost, and the margin below which a trip does not move to assignment without the authorization of Logistics management.",
    lgc_operador_pie: "The driver's fixed salary goes into each trip's cost per day: what they cost a month —salary, benefits and contributions— divided by the working days of the month. The salary is never touched in payroll; here it is only measured.",
    lgc_costos_pie: "This estimates the diesel and the vehicle cost when a trip is created and has no vehicle assigned yet. Once one is assigned, the margin is recalculated with that vehicle's figures.",
    lgc_bono_pie: "What the driver's weekly payroll adds to their commissions. The percentages, amounts and rules are set here, each with its date; the calculation arrives with the drivers' payroll.",
    lgc_tipos_pie: "Each trip asks for a vehicle type and is only offered vehicles of that type. Each fleet vehicle is linked to its type when Fleet arrives. There are no refrigerated units.",
    lgc_patios_pie: "Each trip leaves from and returns to a yard, and the driver clocks in there: the app only lets them clock in inside the yard's geofence.",
    ay_lgc_tabulador_para: "What the driver earns per trip: the amount for the first loaded km and what is added for each extra km, by vehicle type. «Try the table» gives the commission of any trip with the table of its date.",
    ay_lgc_tabulador_cuando: "When the table changes: it is entered in full, with the date it applies from, and earlier trips keep the previous one. If a vehicle type has no amount, its trips cannot be paid.",
    ay_lgc_diesel_para: "The price per litre used to estimate diesel, the buffer added only to the advance and the tolerance above which the fuel efficiency check proposes a charge to the driver.",
    ay_lgc_diesel_cuando: "When the price at the station changes: it is entered with its date, and Monday's can be scheduled on Friday. With an old price, the advance falls short.",
    ay_lgc_alimentos_para: "What the driver gets per day for meals and the minimum margin of a trip.",
    ay_lgc_alimentos_cuando: "When a trip is planned: with an estimated margin below the minimum, the trip does not move to assignment without management's authorization.",
    ay_lgc_operador_para: "What a driver day costs, for each trip's cost: the monthly cost divided by the working days.",
    ay_lgc_operador_cuando: "Every January, with the minimum wage, or when Human Resources changes the benefits. Without it, the trips' margin comes out incomplete.",
    ay_lgc_costos_para: "The reference fuel efficiency and the cost per day of each vehicle type, to estimate diesel and the vehicle cost before one is assigned.",
    ay_lgc_costos_cuando: "When Fleet has the purchase value, the years of life and the insurance of each type. A type without this cannot estimate the margin of its trips.",
    ay_lgc_bono_para: "The mobility bonus percentages by seniority, the working days it requires and the weekly guarantee, with its two rules.",
    ay_lgc_bono_cuando: "Before the first drivers' payroll, and every time Human Resources changes a bracket or the guarantee: the change is entered with its date.",
    ay_lgc_tipos_para: "The vehicle types a trip can ask for. It is only offered vehicles of the type requested.",
    ay_lgc_tipos_cuando: "When a new type is added: the commission table and the costs by type ask for it separately, and the screen says what is missing.",
    ay_lgc_patios_para: "The yards trips leave from and return to, with the radius of their geofence.",
    ay_lgc_patios_cuando: "A yard without a location cannot be used to clock in: the driver could not start their working day there.",
